{
  "_readme": [
    "Single source of truth for the content the page repeats: navigation, sectors and the project record.",
    "Edit this file, then run:  python3 tools/build.py   (writes index.html)",
    "Check only (used in CI):    python3 tools/build.py --check",
    "Project fields: slug (stable, lowercase-hyphenated, never reused), name, sector (a key from 'sectors'),",
    "location, area_sqft (whole number or null), floors (as displayed), order_value (as displayed or null),",
    "design_team, status ('Ongoing' / 'Completed YYYY' or null), note, source (where the fact comes from).",
    "Sector 'icon' is a symbol id in assets/icons/icons.svg; the same icon marks the sector everywhere on the page.",
    "Navigation: 'in' lists where a link appears (header, mobile, footer). Keep the order the same as the sections on the page. 'cta': true styles the link as the orange call to action.",
    "Logos (clients and firms): put the file in assets/logos/clients/ or assets/logos/firms/ (SVG best; PNG or WebP at least 400 px wide, transparent background, any colour: the page shows every logo in greyscale) and set 'logo' to its path. Size is read from the file and balanced automatically. With 'logo': null the name is shown instead (clients) or a lettered mark beside the name (firms); 'mark' overrides the letters.",
    "Leave a field null when the source does not state it. Never estimate."
  ],
